"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ غَيْبُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَمَآ أَمْرُ ٱلسَّاعَةِ إِلَّا كَلَمْحِ ٱلْبَصَرِ أَوْ هُوَ أَقْرَبُ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"All that is hidden from view in the heavens and earth belongs to God. The coming of the Hour of Judgement is like the blink of an eye, or even quicker: God has power over everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"And to Allah (belongs)","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"غَيْبُ","en_gloss":"(the) unseen","transliteration":"ghaybu","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَمْرُ","en_gloss":"(is the) matter","transliteration":"amru","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَلَمْحِ","en_gloss":"as a twinkling","transliteration":"kalamḥi","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْبَصَرِ","en_gloss":"(of) the eye","transliteration":"l-baṣari","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":12,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَقْرَبُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) nearer","transliteration":"aqrabu","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"16:77"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","tra